# Restrict notes/unlisted/ (private hub + unlisted notes) to the site owner via CERN SSO.
# Requires "Use .htaccess files" enabled for the site in the Web Services Portal, and an
# application role "owner" (mapped to an e-group containing only akallits) on
# webframeworks-webeos-alexandra-kallitsopoulou in https://application-portal.web.cern.ch/.
# Docs: https://webeos.docs.cern.ch/authorization/
AuthType openid-connect
Require claim cern_roles:owner
# Undocumented shortcut (no role / e-group needed) - test before relying on it:
# Require claim cern_upn:akallits
